By: Howard
H.B. No. 126
A BILL TO BE ENTITLED
AN ACT
relating to repealing or replacing medically unnecessary and
outdated health care restrictions.
BE IT ENACTED BY THE LEGISLATURE OF THE STATE OF TEXAS:
SECTION 1.  Section 171.002(1), Health and Safety Code, is
amended to read as follows:
(1)  "Abortion"
is a medical intervention provided to
individuals who need to end the medical condition of pregnancy. The
term does not include birth control devices or oral contraceptives
[
